{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的第一块大字，尤其是金黄色突出的“憋着一股气”“当作自己人”；随后视线容易被中间第二块同样醒目的大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人心里憋着气，想起从前曾被人当作自己人，短暂地高兴了一会儿。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴、酸涩。\",\n  \"missed\": \"短暂高兴之后为什么转为酸涩；从前的日子已经回不去，以及离开以后是否真的会更好，仍然没有答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大字都很醒目，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块大字里，需要拼接才能理解完整的情绪变化和处境。\",\n    \"两块大字各自都是较长的句子，包含不止一层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5adc2b41-fa4e-4760-9c59-eaee99059a24", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013512074356Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:35:38.247747+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3bd8df85465bf52937cbe665dc5d503831fd37be1594b45ec99d3a3e3096630", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e